Description: Qt6 library to write cross-platform clients for Matrix (development)
 libQuotient is a Qt6-based library to make IM clients for the Matrix
 protocol. It is the backbone of Quaternion, NeoChat and some other projects.
 .
 End-to-end encryption is enabled in this build, so the library is built
 against libolm and OpenSSL libcrypto.
 .
 This package contains the header files, the pkg-config file, the CMake
 package files and the shared library symlink needed to build applications
 against libQuotient.

Package: libquotientqt6-0.9
Architecture: any
Depends: libqt6sql6-sqlite, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt6 library to write cross-platform clients for Matrix
 libQuotient is a Qt6-based library to make IM clients for the Matrix
 protocol. It is the backbone of Quaternion, NeoChat and some other projects.
 .
 End-to-end encryption is enabled in this build, so the library is built
 against libolm and OpenSSL libcrypto. The Qt SQLite driver is pulled in for
 the encryption key database.
